{"2554880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Haddie's Pizzeria", "steam_appid": 2554880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "◆ Knead the dough. Roll out the dough. Every detail, from the stretching and rising of dough to the splashing of sauces and melting of cheese, is finely crafted.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/e94621cd69ad5ce4701ece3259ce3541.poster.avif?t=1784799035\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/e94621cd69ad5ce4701ece3259ce3541.webm?t=1784799035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/e94621cd69ad5ce4701ece3259ce3541.mp4?t=1784799035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>◆ Here is your fully equipped kitchen. Customize your cozy apartment to reflect your unique style and taste. It's your safe space to relax and enjoy while learning to make delicious pizza.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/955119aa366df2ea4032dec9653581a9.avif?t=1784799035\" width=600 height=244 /></span><br><br>◆ The game boasts highly realistic object physics, enabling interaction with ingredients and kitchen tools just as in real life.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/c3250dae5fb06fe82044526c00527497.poster.avif?t=1784799035\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/c3250dae5fb06fe82044526c00527497.webm?t=1784799035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/c3250dae5fb06fe82044526c00527497.mp4?t=1784799035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>◆ Embark on your culinary journey and level up your character’s skills and perks. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/7f551ad6ed52fc47b450a98bd222050b.avif?t=1784799035\" width=600 height=244 /></span><br><br>◆ Cut any ingredients into pieces of any size at different angles. We have implemented the cutting to be as realistic as possible.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/81a986634bbeb73c02a66144f4edc9f9.poster.avif?t=1784799035\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/81a986634bbeb73c02a66144f4edc9f9.webm?t=1784799035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/81a986634bbeb73c02a66144f4edc9f9.mp4?t=1784799035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>◆ Choose ingredients to your taste or according to real-life recipes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/78332b5496245c2919192cced83d994e.avif?t=1784799035\" width=600 height=252 /></span><br><br>◆ The cooking mechanics are meticulously designed, challenging you to master techniques like kneading, slicing, and baking to create the perfect pizza.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/affa576b2fec1ae14120fd33e729e322.poster.avif?t=1784799035\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta